    (property "Source_changes" "Codex adapts BRK8305 A03 USB symbol for GCT USB4110-GF-A. All16 A/B and4 shell pin identities and existing wiring retained. KiCad10 USB4110 footprint copied locally; four SH SMT pads renamed M1-M4. GCT drawing USB4110 revB4,22May2024,sheet1/2. Same X/Y footprint origin/body-front edge; mating height1.68mm versus priorUSB4105 1.73mm. 3D uses inherited datasheet-derived shell envelope, not manufacturer CAD; no USB4105 PTH legs. Assembly/mechanical/USB qualification pending. V12 Codex footprint adaptation: only the two physical outer DGND lands (four native labels A1/B12/A12/B1) change roundrect ratio0.25 to0.40 (radius0.24mm). Centers,0.6x1.15mm land envelope and diameter0.65mm locating holes retained. Native drill-to-copper clearance0.216088mm; connector-scoped0.20mm JLC minimum. Assembly/CAM acceptance remains open; this is not an unchanged GCT land pattern." (at 0 0 0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))
    (property "Assembly_Status" "Reference catalog; imported dnp=no does not preserve Altium assembly variants. Original source excludes MC4 and R75; verify fitted BOM." (at 0 0 0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))
